Lab 8: Integrating Apache ActiveMQ with Camel
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Set up and configure an Apache ActiveMQ message broker
Create Camel routes that integrate with ActiveMQ for message production and consumption
Implement reliable message-based communication patterns using dead letter channels and redelivery
Test and validate messaging flows through unit tests, integration tests, and load tests
Configure and verify message persistence and reliability features
